rooms_desc ({"HANGERYou entered the rebel-mainbase-hanger.In front of you there are some X-Wings, Y-Wings, A-Wings and B-Wings.Pilots are running around.In front of you there stands abig transportship, which is readyto take you to the rebelbase on Yavin 4.Go south to enter the ship.","You enter the famous MILLENIUM FALCON. The owner is Han Solo.He asks you where you want to go ?Chewie, the Copilot, smiles at you when he starts the engines.Go north to enter the Hanger, or south to enter the Yavin 4.","You leave the spaceship and enter Yavin 4.It's a wonderful planet. Everywhere there are many trees.On your lefthandside you see a big building, the rebelheaddepartment.In front of the building, there are many people, who do their jobsvery quickly.Go West to enter the building.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
